# Keep test files out of the language statistics on the repository page.
# Linguist counts them as code otherwise, so GitHub reports the repository's checks instead of its method.
# `-linguist-detectable` is the documented way to unmark a path that linguist would count:
# https://github.com/github-linguist/linguist/blob/main/docs/overrides.md
tests/**           -linguist-detectable
**/tests/**        -linguist-detectable
**/test_*.py       -linguist-detectable
**/*_test.*        -linguist-detectable
**/*.test.*        -linguist-detectable
**/*.spec.*        -linguist-detectable
